Calc: the XLSX sheet data reader includes the formula buffer

0067 calls getFormulaBuffer().isDynamicCellMeta() and setDynamicArray()
in sheetdatacontext.cxx, which saw FormulaBuffer only as a forward
declaration from workbookhelper.hxx. Builds with precompiled headers
got the full class from the precompiled set; the macOS build has none
and failed with "member access into incomplete type".

diff --git a/sc/source/filter/oox/sheetdatacontext.cxx b/sc/source/filter/oox/sheetdatacontext.cxx
index 9992277..92596b1 100644
--- a/sc/source/filter/oox/sheetdatacontext.cxx
+++ b/sc/source/filter/oox/sheetdatacontext.cxx
@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@
 #include <addressconverter.hxx>
 #include <biffhelper.hxx>
 #include <formulaparser.hxx>
+#include <formulabuffer.hxx>
 #include <richstringcontext.hxx>
 #include <sal/log.hxx>
 #include <o3tl/string_view.hxx>
